{"game": "back-4-blood", "language": "brazilian", "appid": 924970, "month": "2025-10", "window": 3, "start_date": 1760572800, "end_date": 1761263999, "month_true_total": 45, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-30 19:37:58 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "207287542", "author": {"steamid": "76561199007524283", "personaname": "Melzi", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/BrunoMelzi/", "num_games_owned": 93, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 643, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 618, "last_played": 1761106965, "avatar": "0c7eff4e27c2d0ee6e9d01aee0852daa8ee2e1ed"}, "language": "brazilian", "review": "bom", "timestamp_created": 1761106961, "timestamp_updated": 1761106961, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "207277902", "author": {"steamid": "76561199111047558", "personaname": "AKessia", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199111047558/", "num_games_owned": 33, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 1931, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 543, "last_played": 1783896135, "avatar": "5c51ca468a1d37f32931d310ea391b87c294d082"}, "language": "brazilian", "review": "É um jogo com gráficos bons, gostei da dinâmica do sistema de mira, é um jogo difícil e tem vários níveis de dificuldade fazendo com que seja cada vez mais desafiador de zerar. É um jogo bem legal e fica melhor ainda jogando com amigos.\n", "timestamp_created": 1761093993, "timestamp_updated": 1761093993, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "207209378", "author": {"steamid": "76561198199647382", "personaname": "Nemesis", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/nemesis226/", "num_games_owned": 78, "num_reviews": 32, "playtime_forever": 1502, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 887, "last_played": 1761523736, "avatar": "2375e9cab110fd53bbac2524c3b8100a8bc1c840"}, "language": "brazilian", "review": "Esse game traz a boa e velha matança de Left4Dead, eu achei que estava me divertindo jogando solo, até começar a jogar coop com os amigos, passou 7H de gameplay e a gente nem notou o tempo passar.\nEu achei que o sistema de deck não encaixaria o esse tipo de jogo, mas encaixou muito bem, possibilita varias builds doidas.\nFoi graças a ela que consegui fazer um Medico porradeiro tank que cura todos a volta enquanto esmaga crânios de zumbis hehehe. \nRecomendo fortemente pegar o game para jogar com os amigos.", "timestamp_created": 1761010955, "timestamp_updated": 1761011238, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "207204893", "author": {"steamid": "76561199003883066", "personaname": "R.Sakai", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/robertosakai/", "num_games_owned": 135, "num_reviews": 37, "playtime_forever": 375, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 290, "last_played": 1762051891, "avatar": "a64e32a30325cd5e327de9186fe3242dc2ef1dc7"}, "language": "brazilian", "review": "Bom jogo pelo Preço ,Recomendo", "timestamp_created": 1761003961, "timestamp_updated": 1761003961, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny":